                <mxCell id="76" value="&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(36, 36, 36); letter-spacing: -0.06px;&quot;&gt;As distribuições de probabilidade desempenham um papel crucial na modelagem e análise de fenômenos aleatórios em várias áreas, desde estatísticas até ciência de dados e engenharia&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing: -0.06px; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin:0in&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;As principais distribuições de probabilidade modelam incertezas:&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;discretas&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Bernoulli, Binomial,&amp;nbsp;Poisson) tratam de contagens finitas ou enumeráveis, enquanto&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: bold;&quot;&gt;contínuas&lt;/span&gt;&amp;nbsp;(Normal, Uniforme,&amp;nbsp;Exponencial) lidam com medidas dentro de intervalos. A Normal é fundamental&amp;nbsp;para dados contínuos, e a Binomial/Poisson são cruciais para contagens.&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(10, 10, 10); background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial;&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;margin-block: 24px 12px; font-weight: 600; line-height: 28px; color: rgb(0, 29, 53); margin-inline: 0px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; data-animation-nesting=&quot;&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; class=&quot;otQkpb&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Distribuições de Probabilidade Discretas&lt;span style=&quot;visibility: hidden;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-uids=&quot;ejIkBc_1i,ejIkBc_1j&quot; class=&quot;txxDge notranslate&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;text-wrap-mode: nowrap; position: relative;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;class=ejIkBc_1h/TKHnVd&quot; data-animation-atomic=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;vKEkVd&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-processed=&quot;true&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;button style=&quot;margin: 0px 6px 0px 0px; background-color: rgb(229, 237, 255); border-width: initial; border-style: none; border-color: initial; border-radius: 10px; height: 20px; padding: 0px; width: 20px; position: relative; outline: 0px; cursor: pointer;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-ved=&quot;2ahUKEwiah_qJzs2SAxXkHrkGHfvCC_YQye0OegQIAxAA&quot; data-wiz-attrbind=&quot;disabled=ejIkBc_1h/C5gNJc;aria-label=ejIkBc_1h/bOjMyf;class=ejIkBc_1h/UpSNec&quot; class=&quot;rBl3me&quot; aria-label=&quot;Mostrar links relacionados&quot; data-icl-uuid=&quot;fb05b168-eb1a-45c9-9f94-c3a5b7ee340f&quot; data-amic=&quot;true&quot; tabindex=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(0, 29, 53); display: inline-block; transform: rotate(135deg);&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;wiMplc ofC0Ud&quot;&gt;&lt;svg viewBox=&quot;0 0 24 24&quot; xmlns=&quot;http://www.w3.org/2000/svg&quot; height=&quot;12px&quot; width=&quot;12px&quot; fill=&quot;currentColor&quot; style=&quot;margin-top: 3px;&quot;&gt;&lt;path d=&quot;M3.9 12c0-1.71 1.39-3.1 3.1-3.1h4V7H7c-2.76 0-5 2.24-5 5s2.24 5 5 5h4v-1.9H7c-1.71 0-3.1-1.39-3.1-3.1zM8 13h8v-2H8v2zm9-6h-4v1.9h4c1.71 0 3.1 1.39 3.1 3.1s-1.39 3.1-3.1 3.1h-4V17h4c2.76 0 5-2.24 5-5s-2.24-5-5-5z&quot;&gt;&lt;/path&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 12px 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-inline: 0px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAQQAA&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot;&gt;Estas distribuições aplicam-se a variáveis que assumem valores inteiros e contáveis.&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 12px 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-inline: 0px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAQQAA&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 12px 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-inline: 0px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAQQAA&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none none; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);&quot; class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; margin-bottom: -0.46em; list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 30px; margin-top: 2.14em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);&quot; id=&quot;0546&quot; class=&quot;mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf oj ok ol bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700;&quot; class=&quot;mk gn&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Distribuição de Normal (Gussiana)&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 12px 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-inline: 0px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAQQAA&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;É&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent; color: rgb(63, 63, 63);&quot;&gt;contínua e simétrica em forma de sino, definida pela média (𝜇) e desvio padrão (𝜎). É a distribuição mais comum na natureza,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;margin: 0in;&quot;&gt;&lt;font&gt;modelando variáveis como altura, peso e erros de medição.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);&quot; id=&quot;ba73&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;line-height: 24px; overflow-wrap: break-word; margin-block: 12px 16px; color: rgb(10, 10, 10); margin-inline: 0px;&quot; data-processed=&quot;true&quot; data-hveid=&quot;CAQQAA&quot; data-sfc-cp=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;Y3BBE&quot;&gt;&lt;ul class=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 0px; padding: 0px; list-style: none none; color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.8);&quot;&gt;&lt;li id=&quot;0546&quot; class=&quot;mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf oj ok ol bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em; margin-bottom: -0.46em; list-style-type: disc; margin-left: 30px; margin-top: 2.14em;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mk gn&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; font-weight: 700;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;Distribuição de Bernoulli&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;ba73&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em;&quot;&gt;A distribuição de probabilidade Bernoulli modela um único experimento binário, onde o resultado é um sucesso com probabilidade&amp;nbsp;&lt;em class=&quot;om&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;p&lt;/em&gt;&amp;nbsp;ou um fracasso com probabilidade&amp;nbsp;&lt;em class=&quot;om&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;(1 — p)&lt;/em&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;e1c5&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em;&quot;&gt;A função de probabilidade de Bernoulli descreve o resultado de um experimento aleatório que pode ter apenas dois resultados possíveis: sucesso ou fracasso.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;f09e&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em;&quot;&gt;Seja X uma variável aleatória que representa o resultado do experimento, onde X = 1 indica sucesso e X = 0 indica fracasso. Seja p a probabilidade de sucesso, então a função de probabilidade de Bernoulli é dada por:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;37cf&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em;&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;om&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;P(X = x) = p^x * (1-p)^(1-x)&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;31e4&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em;&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;om&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;para x = 0 ou x = 1.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;31e4&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em;&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;om&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p id=&quot;31e4&quot; class=&quot;pw-post-body-paragraph mi mj gm mk b ml mm mn mo mp mq mr ms mt mu mv mw mx my mz na nb nc nd ne nf gf bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 2.14em 0px -0.46em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36); word-break: break-word; line-height: 32px; letter-spacing: -0.003em;&quot;&gt;&lt;em class=&quot;om&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=22;fontFamily=Helvetica;" parent="1" vertex="1">
